---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="FAQ"
  description="Frequently asked questions about NyankoTools, covering pricing, how your data is handled, and how to use the tools."
>
  <h1 class="mb-2 text-2xl font-bold">Frequently Asked Questions</h1>
  <p class="mb-8 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
    Here are answers to common questions about NyankoTools. If you can't find
    what you're looking for, please reach out via the
    <a
      href="/en/contact/"
      class="text-blue-700 underline hover:text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-400 dark:hover:text-blue-300"
    >
      contact form
    </a>
    .
  </p>

  <div class="max-w-2xl space-y-8 text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-300">
    <section>
      <h2 class="mb-2 text-lg font-semibold">Q. Is it free to use?</h2>
      <p>Yes, every tool is free to use with no account required.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="mb-2 text-lg font-semibold">
        Q. Is my data sent to a server?
      </h2>
      <p>
        No. Every tool runs entirely as client-side processing in your browser,
        and the data you enter is never sent to our servers. See our
        <a
          href="/en/privacy-policy/"
          class="text-blue-700 underline hover:text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-400 dark:hover:text-blue-300"
        >
          Privacy Policy
        </a>
        for details.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="mb-2 text-lg font-semibold">
        Q. Do I need to sign up or log in?
      </h2>
      <p>
        No. You can start using any tool immediately, with no account creation
        or login required.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="mb-2 text-lg font-semibold">
        Q. Can I use it on a smartphone?
      </h2>
      <p>
        Yes, the site is fully responsive and works in mobile and tablet
        browsers.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="mb-2 text-lg font-semibold">
        Q. I'm not sure how to use a tool.
      </h2>
      <p>
        Check the instructions and "Glossary" section on each tool's page. If
        that doesn't resolve it, please reach out via the contact form and we'll
        help.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="mb-2 text-lg font-semibold">
        Q. Can I report a bug or request a new tool?
      </h2>
      <p>
        Please let us know through the
        <a
          href="/en/contact/"
          class="text-blue-700 underline hover:text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-400 dark:hover:text-blue-300"
        >
          contact form
        </a>
        .
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="mb-2 text-lg font-semibold">Q. Who operates this site?</h2>
      <p>
        See the
        <a
          href="/en/about/"
          class="text-blue-700 underline hover:text-blue-900 dark:text-blue-400 dark:hover:text-blue-300"
        >
          About page
        </a>
        .
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="mb-2 text-lg font-semibold">
        Q. Do tools that use the camera or microphone upload video or audio?
      </h2>
      <p>
        No. Webcam, mic, screen recording, QR code reading, and similar tools
        process everything only on your device, after you grant permission in
        your browser. Nothing is sent to a server or stored. You can revoke
        permission at any time in your browser settings.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="mb-2 text-lg font-semibold">
        Q. Does the site store anything in my browser?
      </h2>
      <p>
        Favorites, theme, game best scores, invoice issuer details, UTM Builder
        history, and similar items are kept in your browser's local storage.
        They are never sent to a server and are removed when you clear the
        site's data. See the Privacy Policy for details.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="mb-2 text-lg font-semibold">
        Q. Why is my input still there after reloading the page?
      </h2>
      <p>
        To restore your input after a reload or a language switch, it is
        temporarily kept in the tab's session storage and cleared when you close
        the tab. Tools that handle sensitive data such as passwords or tokens do
        not save it.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="mb-2 text-lg font-semibold">
        Q. Videos and large images are slow to process.
      </h2>
      <p>
        All processing happens on your own device, so larger files take longer.
        Try a shorter file or a smaller image first, and use a recent desktop
        browser (Chrome, Edge, Firefox, or Safari).
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="mb-2 text-lg font-semibold">
        Q. Any tips for using the site?
      </h2>
      <p>
        You can use the search and category filter on the home page, favorite
        tools (drag to reorder), keyboard shortcuts (see the shortcuts page),
        and the light/dark theme switch.
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>
